{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "rosa-boundary",
  "title": "ROSA Boundary — operations",
  "description": "ROSAENG-68823: task-creation outcomes and native Lambda metrics from the App-SRE CloudWatch exporter. Select the datasource for staging or production. Collection is sampled; no totals or availability SLI are inferred.",
  "tags": [
    "rosa-boundary",
    "cloudwatch"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "2m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "ROSAENG-68823",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/ROSAENG-68823",
      "targetBlank": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Exporter onboarding",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://gitlab.cee.redhat.com/service/app-interface/-/merge_requests/220268",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "regex": "/^aws-resources-exporter-(?:stage|production)$/",
        "refresh": 1,
        "description": "Select the existing App-SRE AWS resource datasource for staging or production.",
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "region",
        "label": "Region",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(up{job=~\"cloudwatch-exporter-rosa-boundary-.*\",account=~\"rosa-boundary-(stage|prod)\"}, region)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(up{job=~\"cloudwatch-exporter-rosa-boundary-.*\",account=~\"rosa-boundary-(stage|prod)\"}, region)",
          "refId": "Regions"
        },
        "description": "Regions discovered from Boundary exporter targets in the selected datasource.",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "function",
        "label": "Lambda function",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(aws_lambda_invocations_sum{job=~\"cloudwatch-exporter-rosa-boundary-.*\",account=~\"rosa-boundary-(stage|prod)\",region=~\"${region:regex}\",function_name=~\"rosa-boundary-.*\"}, function_name)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(aws_lambda_invocations_sum{job=~\"cloudwatch-exporter-rosa-boundary-.*\",account=~\"rosa-boundary-(stage|prod)\",region=~\"${region:regex}\",function_name=~\"rosa-boundary-.*\"}, function_name)",
          "refId": "LambdaFunctions"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "rosa-boundary-.*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "ROSA Boundary operations",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Datasource:** ${datasource:text} · **Region:** ${region:text}\n\nCloudWatch graphs show **sampled 60-second buckets, shifted forward 10 minutes** for collection delay. A bucket may appear at multiple query steps; these graphs do not give whole-range totals. No samples can mean idle traffic or missing telemetry. Check collection health below.\n\nTask-creation `success` means the launch workflow returned; it does not establish task readiness. `blocked` is a rejected handover (HTTP 409). Pre-creation rejections and timeouts may emit no outcome. These metrics do not measure end-to-end availability, EFS growth, or actual task lifetime."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Prometheus → exporter scrape",
      "description": "Current Prometheus scrape status, without a CloudWatch offset. Up does not prove CloudWatch datapoints are present.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "up{job=~\"cloudwatch-exporter-rosa-boundary-.*\",account=~\"rosa-boundary-(stage|prod)\",region=~\"${region:regex}\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{account}} · {{region}} · {{instance}}",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "No samples",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Down",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Up",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Exporter → CloudWatch collection",
      "description": "Current exporter error gauge, without an offset. Zero means no reported collection error; it does not prove activity or complete bucket coverage.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "cloudwatch_exporter_scrape_error{job=~\"cloudwatch-exporter-rosa-boundary-.*\",account=~\"rosa-boundary-(stage|prod)\",region=~\"${region:regex}\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{account}} · {{region}} · {{instance}}",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "No samples",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "No reported error",
                  "color": "green"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Collection error",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Task-creation outcomes · sampled 1m buckets",
      "description": "Latest observed 60-second CloudWatch bucket at each query step, shifted forward by 10 minutes using offset 10m for the exporter delay. Buckets can repeat; 120-second scraping can omit intervening buckets. These are sampled period values, not a time-range total or a counter. Missing data is not converted to zero. Counts attempts, including retries, not unique tasks or investigations. Success, failure and blocked are distinct outcomes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "interval": "2m",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "rosaboundary_task_creation_requests_sum{job=~\"cloudwatch-exporter-rosa-boundary-.*\",account=~\"rosa-boundary-(stage|prod)\",region=~\"${region:regex}\",ecscluster=~\"rosa-boundary-.*\"} offset 10m",
          "legendFormat": "{{region}} · {{ecscluster}} · {{outcome}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "No samples",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "always",
            "pointSize": 4,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* · success$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* · failure$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* · blocked$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lambda invocations · sampled 1m buckets",
      "description": "Latest observed 60-second CloudWatch bucket at each query step, shifted forward by 10 minutes using offset 10m for the exporter delay. Buckets can repeat; 120-second scraping can omit intervening buckets. These are sampled period values, not a time-range total or a counter. Missing data is not converted to zero.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
